<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n74743" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀργ-αίνω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀργίζω</span>
			, <i>make angry, enrage,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καὶ γὰρ ἂν πέτρου φύσιν σύ γ᾽
					ὀργάνειας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>OT</u>
					335
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> intr., 
				like
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀργίζομαι</span>
			, <i>grow</i> or <i>be angry,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Tr.</u>
				552
			</span></i> ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινι</span>
			<i>with</i> one, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Alc.</u>
				1106
			</span></i> ; cf. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁρμαίνω</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					11.2
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
